Setup:
├─ Using Fibonacci scale: 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13, 21, 34...
├─ Reference story (baseline): 5 points = "typical feature"
├─ Team of 6 developers
└─ Using Planning Poker (cards-based estimation)

REFERENCE STORY (5 points - baseline):
────────────────────────────────────
"User Can Login with Email and Password"
- Frontend form (1 day)
- Backend API integration (1 day)
- Basic error handling (0.5 days)
- Unit tests (0.5 days)
- Total: ~3 days of work
Complexity: Medium
Risk: Low
Unknowns: None

STORIES TO ESTIMATE:

Story 1: Fix button styling issue
┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│ Size relative to reference?      │
│                                 │
│ Dev: "This is simpler than our  │
│ reference story"                 │
│ QA: "Agreed, just CSS changes"  │
│                                 │
│ Estimate: 1 point (simple)      │
│ Reasoning: ~2-3 hours of work   │
│ Risk: Very low                  │
│ Confidence: High                │
└─────────────────────────────────┘

