│ Dev 1: 5 | Dev 2: 8 | Dev 3: 8 │
│ Dev 4: 8 | Dev 5: 5 | Dev 6: 13│
│                                 │
│ Discussion (5 < 8 cards):       │
│ Dev 1: "I thought just like     │
│ login but it's more complex"    │
│ Dev 6: "Unsure about email      │
│ service integration"            │
│                                 │
│ Dev 6 (13 points advocate):     │
│ "Token generation is tricky,    │
│ email delays, error handling"   │
│                                 │
│ Dev 1 (5 points advocate):      │
│ "It's mostly API work similar   │
│ to login"                       │
│                                 │
│ Final discussion leads to:      │
│ Estimate: 8 points (consensus) │
│ Reasoning: ~4-5 days of work   │
│ Risk: Medium                    │
│ Unknowns: Email service timing │
└─────────────────────────────────┘

Story 3: Implement Two-Factor Authentication
┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│ PO describes complex feature     │
│                                 │
│ Planning Poker Cards:           │
│ Dev 1: 8 | Dev 2: 13 | Dev 3: 21│
│ Dev 4: 13 | Dev 5: 21 | Dev 6: 13│
│                                 │
│ Wide disagreement! Lots of unknowns│
│                                 │
│ Discussion:                     │
│ Dev 2: "We need to research     │
│ 2FA services first"             │
│ Dev 3: "Security review will be │
│ required, adds time"            │
│ Dev 5: "This is complex"        │
│                                 │
│ PO (after discussion):          │
│ "Let's not estimate this yet.   │
│ Add 2FA research to backlog     │
│ first"                          │
│                                 │
│ Action Items:                   │
│ - Research 2FA options (1 point)│
