│                                 │
│ Estimate: DEFERRED (needs       │
│ refinement first)               │
└─────────────────────────────────┘

ANTI-PATTERNS AVOIDED:

❌ Wrong: Pressure to estimate low
Manager: "This should be 3 points"
Team: Estimates 3 (pressured)
Result: Miss deadlines, team frustrated

✅ Right: Realistic estimation
Team: "This is 8 points"
Manager: "Why so high?"
