Forces discussion of unknowns
More accurate than one person
Builds shared understanding

❌ Wrong: Estimation pressure
1st velocity: 18 points
Manager: "Next sprint be 25!"
Team: Estimates high to please manager
3rd sprint: Velocity drops to 15 (overestimated)
Team loses trust

✅ Right: Velocity naturally improves
Sprint 1: 15 points
Sprint 2: 18 points (better understanding)
Sprint 3: 20 points (improved processes)
Sprint 4: 21 points (team skill increases)
Natural improvement over time

FINAL RESULTS:

Sprint Planning with Best Practices:
