│                                     │
│ Team Commitment: "We can do 22     │
│ points comfortably"                │
│                                     │
│ Confidence: HIGH ✓                 │
└─────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- ✓ Relative sizing (not hours) - prevents false precision
- ✓ Story point consistency - calibrated to reference stories
- ✓ Team-based estimation - shared understanding
- ✓ Refinement before planning - unknowns researched
- ✓ Velocity-based capacity - historical data drives planning
- ✗ Pressure to estimate low - accuracy destroyed
- ✗ Estimation as time commitment - confusion and misalignment
- ✗ Solo estimation - individual bias not caught

