1. User Authentication (Epic)
   └─ Login with email
   └─ Forgot password feature
   └─ Two-factor authentication
2. User Profile (Epic)
   └─ Edit profile information
   └─ Upload avatar
   └─ Change password
3. Dashboard
   └─ View analytics
   └─ Export reports
4. Notifications
   └─ Email notifications
   └─ In-app alerts

SPRINT BACKLOG (Current Sprint - 2 weeks):
Selected 4 items totaling 21 points:

Story 1: Login with email (8 points) - DONE
  ├─ Create login form (2 points) - DONE
  ├─ API integration (4 points) - IN PROGRESS
  ├─ Error handling (1 point) - TO DO
  └─ Unit tests (1 point) - TO DO

Story 2: Forgot password (5 points) - TO DO
  ├─ Email template (1 point)
  ├─ Token generation (2 points)
  └─ Reset flow (2 points)

Story 3: Fix login button styling (3 points) - DONE

Bug: Profile image not loading (2 points) - IN PROGRESS
  └─ Debug cloudinary integration (2 points)

Tech Debt: Refactor auth module (3 points) - BLOCKED
  └─ Waiting for security review
```

**Interview Context:** Demonstrates understanding of backlog management, prioritization, and sprint planning. Shows how items flow from strategic planning to tactical execution.

