├─ Immediate: "I'll check with design lead right now"
├─ Called design lead during standup break
├─ Design lead: "Mockups in review, 4 hours until ready"
├─ SM Solution: "Devs work on unblocked tasks, continue on cart after lunch"
└─ Owner: SM to get mockups by 11 AM

RESULT: Resolved in <30 min


Impediment 2: API Rate Limiting
────────────────────────────────
Dev: "Third-party payment API rejecting requests after 100 calls/min"
Blocker since: Yesterday
Impact: Can't load-test payment feature

Root Cause Analysis:
├─ Dev exceeded rate limit (didn't read docs)
├─ API provider limits not documented in team wiki
├─ No dev environment setup guide
└─ Other devs will hit same issue

SM's Response:
├─ Immediate: "Let's reach out to API provider for higher limit"
├─ Long-term: "We'll document this and create setup guide"
├─ Action: SM contacts vendor support
│         (Usually takes 2-4 hours for tier-2 support)
│
├─ Temporary: "Use staging environment for now (has higher limit)"
├─ Owner: SM to get vendor response
└─ Owner: Dev to create setup wiki page

RESULT: Dev unblocked in 2 hours using staging
Future: Other devs avoid same issue


Impediment 3: Unclear Requirements
───────────────────────────────────
