├─ Waterfall process
├─ 6-month release cycle
├─ High defect rate (10+ critical issues per release)
└─ Low team morale

Transformation:
├─ Year 1: Pilot 3 teams (50 people)
├─ Year 2: Expanded to 10 teams (100 people)
├─ Year 3: Full organization transformation
└─ Ongoing: Continuous improvement

Results (After 3 years):
├─ Release cycle: 6 months → 2 weeks
├─ Defects: 10+ → 2-3 per release (80% improvement!)
├─ Team attrition: Decreased 40%
├─ Customer satisfaction: Increased 35%
├─ Time to market: Competitive advantage
└─ Cost: Saved $2M/year in rework
